#: src/class.md:335
msgid ""
"A `Bound<'py, T>` is restricted to the Python lifetime `'py`. To make the "
"object longer lived (for example, to store it in a struct on the Rust side), "
"use `Py<T>`. `Py<T>` needs a `Python<'_>` token to allow access:"
msgstr ""

