"`&T` or `&mut T` references to the Rust data contained in the Python object, "
"or"
msgstr ""

#: src/class.md:995
msgid "`PyRef<T>` and `PyRefMut<T>` reference wrappers."
msgstr ""

#: src/class.md:997
msgid "Examples of each of these below:"
